 "beats": [
  {
   "id": "s0",
   "sid": "S21.1",
   "mode": "world",
   "idea": "(lượt 2)",
   "visual": "(lượt 2: chưa dựng)",
   "line": "Back to Tessa's own loan, and a shortcut many people reach for: pay the 30-year exactly what the 15-year would cost, and assume it ends on the same day.",
   "sound": [],
   "music": 0.3,
   "emotion": "—",
   "next": "—",
   "t0": 0.09,
   "t1": 11.04,
   "cues": {}
  },
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "sid": "S21.2",
   "mode": "world",
   "idea": "(lượt 2)",
   "visual": "(lượt 2: chưa dựng)",
   "line": "At the October eighth rates, it doesn't: it ends about 15 months late.",
   "sound": [],
   "music": 0.3,
   "emotion": "—",
   "next": "—",
   "t0": 11.873,
   "t1": 16.48,
   "cues": {}
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "sid": "S21.3",
   "mode": "world",
   "idea": "(lượt 2)",
   "visual": "(lượt 2: chưa dựng)",
   "line": "To finish in 15 years, she'd add $733 a month on top of the required payment.",
   "sound": [],
   "music": 0.3,
   "emotion": "—",
   "next": "—",
   "t0": 17.18,
   "t1": 24.24,
   "cues": {}
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "sid": "S22.1",
   "mode": "world",
   "idea": "(lượt 2)",
   "visual": "(lượt 2: chưa dựng)",
   "line": "That extra never lowers what the loan requires: the required payment stays where it was, and the loan simply ends sooner.",
   "sound": [],
   "music": 0.3,
   "emotion": "—",
   "next": "—",
   "t0": 25.323,
   "t1": 32.673,
   "cues": {}
  },
  {
   "id": "s4",
   "sid": "S22.2",
   "mode": "world",
   "idea": "(lượt 2)",
   "visual": "(lượt 2: chưa dựng)",
   "line": "Each extra dollar does cut the next month's interest; the payment just stays fixed, so more of it goes to principal.",
   "sound": [],
   "music": 0.3,
   "emotion": "—",
   "next": "—",
   "t0": 33.455,
   "t1": 40.193,
   "cues": {}
  },
  {
   "id": "s5",
   "sid": "S22.3",
   "mode": "world",
   "idea": "(lượt 2)",
   "visual": "(lượt 2: chưa dựng)",
   "line": "That's why the fallback is still there years later, if a month goes wrong.",
   "sound": [],
   "music": 0.3,
   "emotion": "—",
   "next": "—",
   "t0": 40.665,
   "t1": 44.273,
   "cues": {}
  },
  {
   "id": "s6",
   "sid": "S23.1",
   "mode": "world",
   "idea": "(lượt 2)",
   "visual": "(lượt 2: chưa dựng)",
   "line": "Tessa has another practical question: could she send the extra once a year instead of every month?",
   "sound": [],
   "music": 0.3,
   "emotion": "—",
   "next": "—",
   "t0": 45.367,
   "t1": 50.707,
   "cues": {}
  },
  {
   "id": "s7",
   "sid": "S23.2",
   "mode": "world",
   "idea": "(lượt 2)",
   "visual": "(lượt 2: chưa dựng)",
   "line": "That's one payment a year, the same total as the monthly extra.",
   "sound": [],
   "music": 0.3,
   "emotion": "—",
   "next": "—",
   "t0": 51.305,
   "t1": 54.227,
   "cues": {}
  },
  {
   "id": "s8",
   "sid": "S23.3",
   "mode": "world",
   "idea": "(lượt 2)",
   "visual": "(lượt 2: chưa dựng)",
   "line": "Paid that way, the loan ends four months later.",
   "sound": [],
   "music": 0.3,
   "emotion": "—",
   "next": "—",
   "t0": 54.821,
   "t1": 57.267,
   "cues": {}
  },
  {
   "id": "s9",
   "sid": "S24.1",
   "mode": "world",
   "idea": "(lượt 2)",
   "visual": "(lượt 2: chưa dựng)",
   "line": "And it charges about $8,200 more in interest, because each dollar sits on the balance longer before it arrives.",
   "sound": [],
   "music": 0.3,
   "emotion": "—",
   "next": "—",
   "t0": 58.367,
   "t1": 66.587,
   "cues": {}
  },
  {
   "id": "s10",
   "sid": "S24.2",
   "mode": "world",
   "idea": "(lượt 2)",
   "visual": "(lượt 2: chưa dựng)",
   "line": "That isn't a verdict on paying yearly: the money stays in her account longer, and what it earns there isn't counted.",
   "sound": [],
   "music": 0.3,
   "emotion": "—",
   "next": "—",
   "t0": 67.499,
   "t1": 74.387,
   "cues": {}
  },
  {
   "id": "s11",
   "sid": "S24.3",
   "mode": "world",
   "idea": "(lượt 2)",
   "visual": "(lượt 2: chưa dựng)",
   "line": "Which leaves the question underneath all of this: when Tessa puts an extra dollar into the mortgage, what does it actually earn?",
